{"request_id":"sha256:fa2c1a2483288bf6a1dd1fef2d9c7e69c0a16428e25e17058ec581b3811f3c23","units":[{"unit_id":"sha256:ad316ca15a3c67a043ce81f8d66731979112b3a4286fb058c144d21f7084bcb0","reviewed":true,"findings":[{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":443}],"reason":"Enphase Energy, Inc. 2025 Form 10-K risk factor lists, among factors affecting expansion into new markets, 'our ability to manage manufacturing capacity and production.' This is a qualitative statement about managing manufacturing capacity and production for the registrant's products; it states no numeric capacity or actual production quantity and no period-specific amount."},{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":454}],"reason":"Enphase Energy, Inc. 2025 Form 10-K risk factor states that capacity constraints, raw materials shortages, logistics issues, labor shortages and changes in customer requirements, manufacturing facilities or processes have historically caused and may in the future cause reduced manufacturing yields, negatively impacting gross profit and 'our production capacity for, those products,' and that increased rejection and rework rates would result in lower yields, gross profit and production capacity. This is a qualitative statement about the registrant's production capacity for its products; it states no numeric capacity or actual production quantity and no period-specific amount."}],"unresolved":[]}]}